{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2021-07-28 11:01:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIRLINES APPOINTS 34-YEAR AIRLINE VETERAN TO LEAD SALES', 'text': 'SEATTLE, JULY 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALASKA AIRLINES HAS NAMED 34-YEAR AIRLINE VETERAN\xa0TONI FREEBERG MANAGING DIRECTOR OF SALES EFFECTIVE\xa0IMMEDIATELY. FREEBERG ASSUMES THE ROLE CURRENTLY HELD BY MARK BOCCHI, WHO WILL RETIRE FROM ALASKA AIRLINES IN OCTOBER AFTER 40 YEARS.'}